 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>设 $f\_1,f\_2,\cdots,f\_n$ 是 $H$ 上的一组有界线性泛函,&lt;/p>
$$M\overset{\Delta}{=}\bigcap\limits\_{k=1}^n N(f\_k),\quad N(f\_k)\overset{\Delta}{=}\lbrace x\in H|f\_k(x)=0\rbrace $$&lt;p>
&lt;/p>
$$(k=1,2,\cdots,n).$$&lt;p> $\forall x\_0\in H$, 记 $y\_0$ 为 $x\_0$ 在 $M$ 上的正交投影, 求证: $\exists y\_k\in N(f\_k)^{\perp}$ 及 $\alpha\_1,\alpha\_2,\cdots,\alpha\_n\in\mathbb K$, 使得 &lt;/p>
$$y\_0=x\_0-\sum\limits\_{k=1}^n \alpha\_ky\_k.$$</description></item><item><title>泛函分析作业251103</title><link>http://localhost:1313/posts/math/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%9A/251103/</link><pubDate>Fri, 31 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>nan22inf@google.com (uuku)</author><guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/math/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%9A/251103/</guid><category domain="http://localhost:1313/categories/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/">泛函分析</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="214">&lt;span>2.1.4&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#214" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>设 $y(t)\in C[0,1]$, 定义 $C[0,1]$ 上的泛函
&lt;/p>
$$f(x)=\int\_0^1 x(t)y(t)\text{d} t\quad (\forall x\in C[0,1]),$$&lt;p>
求 $\Vert f \Vert$.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>泛函分析作业251020</title><link>http://localhost:1313/posts/math/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%9A/251020/</link><pubDate>Mon, 13 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>nan22inf@google.com (uuku)</author><guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/math/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%9A/251020/</guid><category domain="http://localhost:1313/categories/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/">泛函分析</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="149">&lt;span>1.4.9&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#149" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>在 $\mathbb{R}^2$ 中, 对 $\forall x = (x\_1, x\_2) \in \mathbb{R}^2$, 定义范数&lt;br>
&lt;/p>
$$ 
\Vert x \Vert = \max(|x\_1|, |x\_2|), 
$$&lt;p>&lt;br>
并设 $e\_1 = (1, 0)$, $x\_0 = (0, 1)$. 求 $a \in \mathbb{R}$ 适合&lt;br>
&lt;/p>
$$ 
\Vert x\_0 - a e\_1 \Vert = \min\_{\lambda \in \mathbb{R}} \Vert x\_0 - \lambda e\_1 \Vert, 
$$&lt;p>&lt;br>
并问这样的 $a$ 是否唯一? 请对结果做出几何解释.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>泛函分析作业251008</title><link>http://localhost:1313/posts/math/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%9A/251008/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>nan22inf@google.com (uuku)</author><guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/math/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%9A/251008/</guid><category domain="http://localhost:1313/categories/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/">泛函分析</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="141">&lt;span>1.4.1&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#141" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>在二维空间 $\mathbb{R}^2$ 中, 对每一点 $z = (x, y)$, 令
&lt;/p>
$$
	\|z\|\_1 = |x| &amp;#43; |y|; \quad \|z\|\_2 = \sqrt{x^2 &amp;#43; y^2}; \quad 
	\|z\|\_3 = \max(|x|, |y|); \quad \|z\|\_4 = (x^4 &amp;#43; y^4)^{\frac{1}{4}}.
$$&lt;p>(1) 求证 $\|\cdot\|\_i$ ($i=1,2,3,4$) 都是 $\mathbb{R}^2$ 的范数.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>(2) 画出 $(\mathbb{R}^2, \|\cdot\|\_i)$ ($i=1,2,3,4$) 各空间中的单位球面图形.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>(3) 在 $\mathbb{R}^2$ 中取定三点 $O = (0,0)$, $A = (1,0)$, $B = (0,1)$, 试在上述四种不同范数下求出 $\triangle OAB$ 三边的长度.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>泛函分析作业250929</title><link>http://localhost:1313/posts/math/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%9A/250929/</link><pubDate>Mon, 29 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>nan22inf@google.com (uuku)</author><guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/math/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%9A/250929/</guid><category domain="http://localhost:1313/categories/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/">泛函分析</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="135">&lt;span>1.3.5&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#135" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>设 $M$ 是 $C[a,b]$ 中的有界集, 求证: 集合 &lt;/p>
$$\lbrace F(x)=\int\_a^x f(t) \mathrm{d} t | f\in M\rbrace $$&lt;p> 是列紧集.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>泛函分析作业250922</title><link>http://localhost:1313/posts/math/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%9A/250922/</link><pubDate>Mon, 22 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>nan22inf@google.com (uuku)</author><guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/math/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%9A/250922/</guid><category domain="http://localhost:1313/categories/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/">泛函分析</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="121">&lt;span>1.2.1&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#121" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>(空间 S) 令 $S$ 为一切实 (或复) 数列 &lt;/p>
$$x=(\xi\_1,\xi\_2,\cdots,\xi\_n,\cdots)$$&lt;p> 组成的集合, 在 $S$ 中定义距离为
&lt;/p>
$$\rho(x,y)=\sum\limits\_{k=1}^\infty \frac{1}{2^k}\cdot\frac{|\xi\_k-\eta\_k|}{1&amp;#43;|\xi\_k-\eta\_k|},$$&lt;p>
其中 $x=(\xi\_1,\xi\_2,\cdots,\xi\_k,\cdots),y=(\eta\_1,\eta\_2,\cdots,\eta\_k,\cdots)$. 求证 $S$ 为一个完备的度量空间.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>泛函分析作业250915</title><link>http://localhost:1313/posts/math/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%9A/250915/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>nan22inf@google.com (uuku)</author><guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/math/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%9A/250915/</guid><category domain="http://localhost:1313/categories/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/">泛函分析</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="112">&lt;span>1.1.2&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#112" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>(Newton 法) 设 $f$ 是定义在 $[a,b]$ 上的二次连续可微的实值函数, $\hat{x}\in(a,b)$ 使得 $f(\hat x)=0, f&amp;#39;(\hat x)\neq 0$. 求证: 存在 $\hat x$ 的邻域 $U(\hat x)$, 使得 $\forall x\_0\in U(\hat x)$, 迭代序列
&lt;/p>
$$x\_{n&amp;#43;1}=x\_n-\frac{f(x\_n)}{f&amp;#39;(x\_n)}\quad (n=0,1,2,\ldots)$$&lt;p>
是收敛的, 并且
&lt;/p>
$$\lim\limits\_{n\to\infty}x\_n=\hat x.$$</description></item></channel></rss>